  "title": "Zucchini Noodle Salad with Lemon Garlic Vinaigrette",
  "description": "This zucchini noodle salad with lemon garlic vinaigrette recipe is like a pasta salad with no pasta. This healthy, low-carb meal is loaded with flavor.",
